            "type": "game",
            "name": "Kramora's Shadow",
            "steam_appid": 372080,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore five different worlds, fight their monstrous inhabitants and try to survive and find an ancient artifact to save the world from destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For every game session, the game will create new environments full of challenges and surprises, populated with monsters and ancient magical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are ten different player classes, each one designed with a unique playing style. Some of them are combat-focused, others have access to magic spells in 4 different schools of magic while others must rely on their special martial skills to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance through the game, you will find over 40 different types of monsters with distinct skills and abilities, you will be able to charm them using magic spells and make them join your quest. By using some of the ancient magic found in the dungeon, you can unlock more advanced forms of their powers and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game keeps track of your adventures on its online server, sharing the in-game events with your friends in real time, maintaining a leaderboard of the most successful heroes as well as a graveyard of memorable characters which you can share in social media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ananias is a traditional turn-based &quot;roguelike&quot; adapted for modern players, it removes the cumbersome movement and complex commands while keeping all the features from the genre that make the games fun and enjoyable: turn-based combat, random level generation, and long term item strategy. These are among the things that make every adventure into the game unforgettable.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore five different worlds, fight their monstrous inhabitants and try to survive and find an ancient artifact to save the world from destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For every game session, the game will create new environments full of challenges and surprises, populated with monsters and ancient magical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are ten different player classes, each one designed with a unique playing style. Some of them are combat-focused, others have access to magic spells in 4 different schools of magic while others must rely on their special martial skills to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance through the game, you will find over 40 different types of monsters with distinct skills and abilities, you will be able to charm them using magic spells and make them join your quest. By using some of the ancient magic found in the dungeon, you can unlock more advanced forms of their powers and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game keeps track of your adventures on its online server, sharing the in-game events with your friends in real time, maintaining a leaderboard of the most successful heroes as well as a graveyard of memorable characters which you can share in social media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ananias is a traditional turn-based &quot;roguelike&quot; adapted for modern players, it removes the cumbersome movement and complex commands while keeping all the features from the genre that make the games fun and enjoyable: turn-based combat, random level generation, and long term item strategy. These are among the things that make every adventure into the game unforgettable.</p>",
            "short_description": "A turn-based traditional roguelike featuring 10 character classes with unique gameplay styles. Explore five ancient realms to find ancient magical artifacts you will need to survive tactical battles against their evil inhabitants. Can you save the world from the wrath of Kramora?",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês",
            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
